**/.next/
**/dist/
**/build/

**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache/
**/tests/
**/requirements-dev.txt

.env
.env.*
!.env.example

**/.DS_Store
*.log
docs/
*.md
!rag/knowledge-base/**/*.md
